Agent Web Browser (AWB) build patch.
1. Allows authenticated API navigation to glassdoor.com, ziprecruiter.com,
   linkedin.com, and indeed.com (validate_api_navigation).
2. Registers LinkedIn/Indeed platforms (Rust registry + frontend tabs) and
   exposes createTab/switchTab to the loopback bridge.
3. Renames the app to 'Agent Web Browser' (window title, brand, health app).
4. Fixes clipped dropdown overlays: new set_chrome_overlay command grows the
   56px tab-bar webview so the hamburger/new-tab menus, URL editor, and
   extensions panel can open over tab content.
5. Pins AppUserModelID com.barnsl.agent-web-browser at startup so all windows
   group under one taskbar icon.

